      "id": 167,
      "slug": "huka",
      "title": "Huka",
      "artists": [
        "Bigitam",
        "Elastic"
      ],
      "genre": "Psy Trance",
      "links": {
        "store": "https://cometcollective.ampsuite.com/store/view_release?release=167"
      },
      "blurb": "Bigitam & Elastic are back with 'Huka', the next chapter of a story that began somewhere on the dancefloor at ZNA Festival. What started with 'Zambu' has slowly turned into an ongoing musical adventure, filled with memories, unexpected moments, and a few inside jokes shared between the two. This time, the story takes a slightly different turn, inspired by a rather unusual pair of shoes that somehow became impossible to forget. With oversized steps, playful energy, and a groove of its own, 'Huka' picks up right where 'Zambu' left off, proving that some festival stories are simply too good to end.",
